OL,3,GNEWSAMan denies plotting terror attack
OL,4,Aat migrant hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn alleged white supremacist has denied
OL,7,Fplotting to firebomb a migrant hotel in
OL,8,FHull.
OL,10,FMikka Lee Anderson, 24, of Morpeth
OL,11,FStreet, Hull, is accused of planning to
OL,12,Fattack the Royal Hotel in February
OL,13,Fusing petrol bombs.
OL,15,FHe was arrested after meeting a
OL,16,Fwould-be accomplice who later reported
OL,17,Fhim to police, Newcastle Crown Court
OL,18,Fwas told.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
